  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "POST/PUT requests may provide an interaction model, so a helper method should be added to populate a Link header with rel=\"type\".",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "It would be helpful to user to provide a set of constants for interaction models defined by the specification, while also allowing for implementation specific models. The set of defined interaction models are:",
