  "description": "<p>POST/PUT requests may provide an interaction model, so a helper method should be added to populate a Link header with rel=\"type\".</p>\n\n<p>It would be helpful to user to provide a set of constants for interaction models defined by the specification, while also allowing for implementation specific models. The set of defined interaction models are:</p>\n<ul>\n\t<li><a href=\"http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#NonRDFSource\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#NonRDFSource</a></li>\n\t<li><a href=\"http://mementoweb.org/ns#OriginalResource\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://mementoweb.org/ns#OriginalResource</a></li>\n\t<li><a href=\"http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#DirectContainer\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#DirectContainer</a></li>\n\t<li><a href=\"http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#IndirectContainer\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#IndirectContainer</a></li>\n\t<li><a href=\"http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#DirectContainer\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#DirectContainer</a></li>\n\t<li><a href=\"http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#Resource\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#Resource</a></li>\n</ul>\n",
  "duedate": null,
  "environment": "POST/PUT requests may provide an interaction model, so a helper method should be added to populate a Link header with rel=&quot;type&quot;.\r<br/>\n\r<br/>\nIt would be helpful to user to provide a set of constants for interaction models defined by the specification, while also allowing for implementation specific models. The set of defined interaction models are:\r<br/>\n* <a href=\"http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#NonRDFSource\">http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#NonRDFSource</a>\r<br/>\n* <a href=\"http://mementoweb.org/ns#OriginalResource\">http://mementoweb.org/ns#OriginalResource</a>\r<br/>\n* <a href=\"http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#DirectContainer\">http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#DirectContainer</a>\r<br/>\n* <a href=\"http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#IndirectContainer\">http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#IndirectContainer</a>\r<br/>\n* <a href=\"http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#DirectContainer\">http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#DirectContainer</a>\r<br/>\n* <a href=\"http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#Resource\">http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#Resource</a>",
